{"id":5477,"date":"2019-02-11T15:01:13","date_gmt":"2019-02-11T20:01:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=5477"},"modified":"2019-02-11T18:01:15","modified_gmt":"2019-02-11T23:01:15","slug":"how-do-they-make-those","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/02\/11\/how-do-they-make-those\/","title":{"rendered":"How Do They Make Those?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Once or twice each month we (folks here at Rover&#8217;s Roost RV Park) have what we call a &#8220;Tag Along&#8221;.  We just hop in our car (or someone else&#8217;s) and head out on a road trip.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This month about 10 or 12 of us went up to the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.dwarfcarmuseum.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Dwarf Car Museum (opens in a new tab)\">Dwarf Car Museum<\/a> just southwest of Maricopa, about 30 minutes west of our park.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"330\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/Map.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5478\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/Map.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/Map-300x130.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/Map-768x334.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/Map-685x298.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>Quick trip out I-8 to the museum<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>A lot of us really didn&#8217;t know what to expect .. and boy were we impressed!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ernie and his helpers have, over the years built from scratch little 5\/8 scale automobiles. These are real beauties as the pictures below illustrate. But what is really fascinating is that they are all made from flat sheet stock! They make their own roofs, fenders, door panels along with all the stainless (looks like chrome) grills, trim, headlight rings, window frames &#8230;. and more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They will take a stock steering wheel from a junkyard and cut it down (taking sections of the diameter out) so that it becomes a smaller version of itself.  On the dashboard, even though the actual dash is scratch made from sheet steel and stainless &#8230; what about the gauges?  They use stock gauges but cut out part of the dial (or scale) to make it smaller and then hand paint the markings back on the face plate before cutting down the glass and reinstalling.  Painstaking work.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125720.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5480\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125720.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125720-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125720-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125720-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125720-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125720-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>The museum is really more of a shop &#8211; Out in the middle of nowhere<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_130631-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5488\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_130631-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_130631-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_130631-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_130631-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_130631-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>How it came to be &#8230;<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Click on any of the images below to see a larger view<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125939.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5481\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5481\" class=\"wp-image-5481\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125939.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125939-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125939-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125939-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125939-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_125939-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>&#8217;54 Chevy<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/20190207_130018.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5482\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5482\" class=\"wp-image-5482\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/upl